@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### API home
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Create a student (dummy data only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aarav Patil",
  "date_of_birth": "2005-04-12",
  "email": "aarav.demo@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "course": "Computer Engineering",
  "address": "Pune, Maharashtra",
  "enrollment_date": "2025-08-01"
}

### List students
GET {{baseUrl}}/students

### Filter students by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/students?name=Aarav

### Get student by ID (change 1 to the returned ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/1

### Partially update a student
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "course": "Information Technology"
}

### Replace student details (send all required fields)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aarav Patil",
  "date_of_birth": "2005-04-12",
  "email": "aarav.demo@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "course": "Information Technology",
  "address": "Pune, Maharashtra",
  "enrollment_date": "2025-08-01"
}

### Delete student
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/students/1
